    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero is not the one with the sword, but the one with the rope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against the monsters that threw the world into chaos, he made himself the balancer between heaven and earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move quickly to dodge the boss's attacks, and wrap the rope around it to deliver a fatal blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win in this world, you must be as fast as light and as sharp as an eagle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Boss Battle]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against powerful bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will try to kill you with indiscriminate attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Controls]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various platforming techniques</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move quickly using ropes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemy patterns and counterattack</p></li></ul>",
